{"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"t":"GREG:","y":0.091569767195432861,"x":0.067961165866729831,"w":0.046601940790812174},{"h":0.011627906728013615,"y":0.12500000005169087,"x":0.066019418026924015,"c":1,"t":"JULIE:","w":0.046601940790812174},{"c":1,"x":0.06796116593729655,"w":0.044660193125406894,"h":0.013081395514657479,"t":"GREG:","y":0.15697674393961891},{"w":0.04466019312540688,"h":0.011627906728013615,"y":0.17441860474910098,"t":"JULIE:","c":1,"x":0.066019417907729042},{"h":0.011627906728013615,"c":1,"x":0.067961165476131499,"t":"GREG:","w":0.044660193125406908,"y":0.2223837210293198},{"w":0.044719368616739905,"y":0.23686206491910311,"t":"JULIE:","x":0.065989830506571062,"h":0.013194474550051072,"c":1},{"w":0.04660194079081216,"y":0.27034883707188628,"c":1,"x":0.067961165510742785,"t":"GREG:","h":0.01308139551465759},{"h":0.011627906728013615,"c":1,"y":0.3183139534964583,"x":0.067961165825646055,"w":0.044660193125406894,"t":"JULIE:"},{"c":1,"t":"GREG:","w":0.044660193125406894,"y":0.33430232551196215,"h":0.011627906728013615,"x":0.069902913696196223},{"w":0.044784081776936852,"h":0.010481901555046469,"c":1,"t":"JULIE:","x":0.067899221162897774,"y":0.35159044453798083},{"w":0.60993810017903649,"y":0.086967276167805752,"t":"Well, they want someone who can start at a quarter to eight in the morning -","x":0.16299872094711124,"h":0.020812630579107649,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883112922281,"x":0.16310679776813566,"t":"could you manage that?","y":0.10610465145782255,"w":0.19417475382486979,"c":1},{"h":0.022005752611011675,"t":"Yes, my husband would have to get the kids up and off to my mother's - she's","y":0.11708773336025635,"w":0.61975997924804693,"x":0.16293821388529353,"c":1},{"t":"going to be looking after them while I'm at work. What time would I finish?","x":0.16286388045269196,"h":0.022041905483352831,"c":1,"y":0.13363916664019759,"w":0.58492574055989588},{"t":"One fifteen.","x":0.16484468966034455,"y":0.15516074938049762,"c":1,"w":0.095625947316487658,"h":0.014430625416408049},{"x":0.16495564095013501,"y":0.16838756648554698,"w":0.62543390909830732,"h":0.018577690956377069,"t":"That should work out all right. I can pick the kids up on my way home, and then","c":1},{"x":0.16494204232360232,"t":"I'Il have the afternoon with them. Oh, one thing... is there parking available for","y":0.1842101589968228,"w":0.62546564737955734,"h":0.019307477006288321,"c":1},{"x":0.16310679560736593,"t":"staff at the centre?","y":0.20342679137742337,"h":0.013142976136965245,"c":1,"w":0.15145631154378256},{"x":0.16292313117831858,"y":0.21617859725567135,"w":0.330424321492513,"c":1,"h":0.020365554001472441,"t":"Yes, there is, and it's also on a bus route."},{"c":1,"t":"Right. Well, I expect I'Il have the car but it's good to know that.","w":0.49333872477213547,"h":0.016959496970488708,"x":0.16497070780949799,"y":0.23338075467870878},{"w":0.26068280537923183,"x":0.16483713008323689,"t":"OK, so where do I go from here?","y":0.2498877030516804,"h":0.017936107599846762,"c":1},{"x":0.16301363910266833,"w":0.61189178466796879,"y":0.26448413534697712,"t":"Well, if you're happy for me to do so, I'Il forward your CV and references, and","h":0.020521194838289181,"c":1},{"t":"then the best thing would probably be for you to phone them so they can arrange","x":0.1629801630467845,"y":0.28075331341273568,"h":0.019549786338925013,"c":1,"w":0.64296813964843746},{"y":0.30087209292776729,"t":"for an interview.","w":0.13009708404541018,"h":0.01314659891098835,"c":1,"x":0.16310679766176098},{"w":0.26815546671549478,"h":0.017316159875222059,"c":1,"x":0.16494208872988603,"t":"Great. Well thank you very much.","y":0.31530522827609864},{"y":0.33271028021226734,"c":1,"w":0.21165047963460287,"h":0.014673440404398774,"x":0.16504854645122186,"t":"You're welcome. Bye now."},{"c":1,"t":"Bye.","w":0.040776697794596362,"y":0.34883720923917039,"x":0.16504854393765328,"h":0.015988371899566256},{"c":1,"t":"PART 2","x":0.069881199699669425,"h":0.016144986018956309,"y":0.40108448371431993,"w":0.10295604705810547},{"x":0.071742211842779013,"w":0.73032933553059887,"y":0.42690509061376658,"h":0.019162405614169598,"c":1,"t":"Good morning everyone, and welcome to the Museum of Farming Life. I understand it's your"},{"x":0.069780209767987225,"h":0.020039396196882331,"c":1,"t":"first visit here, so I'd like to give you some background information about the museum and","y":0.44348579477836791,"w":0.71094065348307289},{"t":"then explain a little about what you can see during your visit.","c":1,"y":0.46167511816971474,"w":0.48170461018880212,"x":0.067876075210538331,"h":0.017760133594738825},{"c":1,"y":0.48472242224776596,"x":0.071758124196404371,"w":0.66039011637369793,"t":"So, where we're standing at the moment is the entrance to a large building that was","h":0.018334957966552046},{"c":1,"x":0.069777309253158157,"t":"constructed in 1880 as the home of a local businessman, Alfred Palmer, of the Palmer biscuit","w":0.73810302734375,"h":0.018890109908914932,"y":0.50006551890288309},{"y":0.5164561165303444,"t":"factory. It was later sold and became a hall of residence for students in 1911, and a museum","c":1,"w":0.73029632568359371,"h":0.018722140826168743,"x":0.069806834961354314},{"c":1,"t":"in 1951. In 2005, a modern extension was built to accommodate the museum's collections.","y":0.53284114771123159,"x":0.067882764772344423,"h":0.020193319825739908,"w":0.7225013732910156},{"w":0.70886510213216147,"c":1,"y":0.5579266116809799,"h":0.018192474270164016,"t":"The museum's owned by the university, and apart from two rooms that are our offices, the","x":0.071781829767213076},{"w":0.71471104939778651,"y":0.57308564274092377,"h":0.018828600589360089,"t":"university uses the main part of the building. You may see students going into the building.","x":0.069802499456230294,"c":1},{"w":0.72830825805664068,"h":0.016572564264695555,"x":0.071776143778412807,"c":1,"t":"for lessons, but it's not open to museum visitors, I'm afraid. It's a shame because the interior","y":0.59028430201294568},{"t":"architectural features are outstanding, especially the room that used to be the library.","x":0.069791163930434552,"y":0.6057978476590965,"w":0.67205301920572924,"h":0.019459678673669933,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.62923808001694959,"w":0.70317947387695312,"t":"Luckily, we've managed to keep entry to the museum free. This includes access to all the","x":0.071708437910569009,"h":0.020128527014426356},{"c":1,"y":0.64603751310371349,"t":"galleries, outdoor areas and the rooms for special exhibitions. We run activities for children","h":0.020057794683818853,"x":0.069780881971331796,"w":0.71868718465169268},{"t":"and students, such as the museum club, for which there's no charge. We do have a donation","h":0.021870479405483367,"w":0.73813893636067718,"x":0.069757461340136426,"y":0.66067334473029982,"c":1},{"w":0.65062220255533854,"t":"box just over there so feel free to give whatever amount you consider appropriate.","y":0.67869090290669676,"h":0.017665801241390389,"x":0.069825606056204303,"c":1},{"w":0.73414586385091152,"h":0.017757727721027128,"c":1,"t":"We do have a cloakroom, if you'd like to leave your coats and bags somewhere. Unlike other","y":0.70255454340966794,"x":0.07176167969795548},{"x":0.069800397233104494,"y":0.7181180808903721,"t":"museums, photography is allowed here, so you might like to keep your cameras with you.","c":1,"h":0.019576848704495609,"w":0.71086507161458334},{"t":"You might be more comfortable not carrying around heavy rucksacks, though keep your coats","y":0.73496838714501267,"w":0.74383738199869787,"x":0.069829456049363706,"h":0.018598461448217751,"c":1},{"x":0.071761823304754557,"w":0.48363525390624995,"t":"and jackets on as it's quite cold in the museum garden today.","y":0.75265055992442276,"h":0.016305858695247144,"c":1},{"y":0.79795332126986696,"h":0.019608890378957966,"x":0.07171270093813556,"t":"I'd like to tell you about the different areas of the museum.","w":0.46237477620442713,"c":1},{"w":0.71287755330403635,"h":0.020801739083643578,"y":0.82133748083494451,"c":1,"t":"Just inside, and outside the main gallery, we have an area called Four Seasons. Here you","x":0.069778478433832308},{"c":1,"t":"can watch a four-minute animation of a woodland scene. It was designed especially for the","h":0.020282664551541818,"x":0.071694819927417372,"y":0.83739308142747138,"w":0.71871495564778654},{"x":0.071703496999646454,"w":0.70121668497721346,"h":0.019339721893595785,"c":1,"t":"museum by a group of young people on a film studies course, and it's beautiful. Children","y":0.85405485777701595},{"h":0.016014634485927992,"w":0.32233009338378904,"y":0.87352024912701431,"c":1,"t":"absolutely love it, but then, so do adults.","x":0.071844662059643835},{"y":0.89456064228145149,"w":0.71091710408528641,"c":1,"x":0.071725103076673902,"h":0.020324632163359668,"t":"The main gallery's called Town and Country. It includes a photographic collection of prize-"},{"w":0.71085622151692707,"x":0.071740545910026113,"h":0.019841017084329615,"t":"winning sheep and shepherds. Leaving Town and Country, you enter Farmhouse Kitchen,","c":1,"y":0.91104505601172159},{"t":"which is ... well, self-explanatory. Here we have the oldest collection of equipment for making","w":0.73806060791015626,"h":0.019628282945104103,"c":1,"y":0.92717909661780018,"x":0.07174241066304414},{"y":0.037694704245877952,"w":0.064077669779459723,"c":1,"h":0.014641744548286595,"t":"Test 4","x":0.83883495142094977},{"t":"Q9","x":0.83106796042865905,"h":0.01453488311292217,"y":0.1511627909356108,"c":1,"w":0.027184467315673921},{"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"t":"Q10","w":0.038834950129191137,"y":0.18313953500603886,"x":0.83106796202278299},{"y":0.4999999998734852,"c":1,"w":0.034951454798380466,"x":0.8349514569762142,"t":"Q11","h":0.01308139551465759},{"y":0.57267441886323367,"c":1,"w":0.036893202463785801,"t":"Q12","h":0.014534883112922281,"x":0.834951456929515},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"c":1,"t":"Q13","y":0.66133720956595488,"h":0.01453488311292217,"x":0.83495145692884065},{"c":1,"w":0.036893202463785801,"t":"Q14","y":0.70203488360168287,"h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.83495145692884065},{"c":1,"t":"Q15","x":0.8368932045023304,"w":0.036893202463785912,"y":0.83720930258416382,"h":0.014534883112922281},{"c":1,"x":0.86990291346713622,"w":0.036893202463785801,"t":"115","y":0.95348837225167837,"h":0.01453488311292217}],"h":3209}